## 九、性能优化

### 虚拟滚动

对于大地图，只渲染可视区域内的地块：

```typescript
function getVisibleTiles(
  scrollX: number,
  scrollY: number,
  viewportWidth: number,
  viewportHeight: number,
  tileSize: number,
  mapWidth: number,
  mapHeight: number
): { startRow: number; endRow: number; startCol: number; endCol: number } {
  const buffer = 2;  // 缓冲区
  
  return {
    startCol: Math.max(0, Math.floor(scrollX / tileSize) - buffer),
    endCol: Math.min(mapWidth, Math.ceil((scrollX + viewportWidth) / tileSize) + buffer),
    startRow: Math.max(0, Math.floor(scrollY / tileSize) - buffer),
    endRow: Math.min(mapHeight, Math.ceil((scrollY + viewportHeight) / tileSize) + buffer),
  };
}
```

